class: negative
summary: Writing a present static pointer through an alias leaves no reusable empty proof on the original optional binding, so a writable from clause hiding it is still refused
constructs: 0430, 0480, 0790
program: program.ldn
codes: L0316
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, macos-arm64, synthetic-32, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64, linux-rv64
